# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# HydroSense Client — Environment Variables
# Copy this to .env and fill in your values. NEVER commit .env.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Google OAuth Client ID (from Google Cloud Console — Web application type)
# Required for "Sign in with Google" button on the login page.
# Create a project at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# then add http://localhost:3000 to Authorized JavaScript origins.
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id.apps.googleusercontent.com
